<view class="page price-page">
  <view class="price-hero">
    <text class="kicker">新能源电价</text>
    <text class="title">每天看清光伏、风电卖多少钱。</text>
    <text class="copy">这里固定记录光伏和风电今日参考电价，单位为元/千瓦时；其他价格信号随日报补充。</text>
  </view>

  <view class="range-tabs">
    <button
      class="range-tab {{rangeDays === item.value ? 'active' : ''}}"
      wx:for="{{rangeOptions}}"
      wx:key="value"
      data-range="{{item.value}}"
      bindtap="setRange"
    >{{item.label}}</button>
  </view>

  <view class="tariff-list">
    <view class="tariff-card" wx:for="{{trend}}" wx:key="id">
      <view class="tariff-head">
        <view>
          <text class="tariff-label">{{item.label}}</text>
          <text class="tariff-dates">{{item.dates}}</text>
        </view>
        <view class="tariff-value">
          <text>{{item.latestValueText}}</text>
          <text>{{item.unit}}</text>
        </view>
      </view>

      <view class="tariff-change">
        <text>{{item.latestLevel}}</text>
        <text>{{item.rangeText}} / {{item.deltaText}}，{{item.directionText}}</text>
      </view>

      <view class="tariff-chart">
        <view class="axis-line"></view>
        <view class="axis-line axis-mid"></view>
        <view class="axis-line axis-top"></view>
        <view class="price-point" wx:for="{{item.bars}}" wx:for-item="point" wx:key="date">
          <text class="point-value">{{point.valueText}}</text>
          <view class="point-marker" style="margin-top: {{point.offset}}rpx;">
            <view class="point-dot"></view>
            <view class="point-column" style="height: {{point.height}}rpx;"></view>
          </view>
          <text class="point-date">{{point.date}}</text>
        </view>
      </view>

      <text class="tariff-note">{{item.note}}</text>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="risk-note">
    <text>电价数据仅供学习参考，不构成交易、投资或正式报价依据。</text>
  </view>
</view>
